# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 🛡️ MadiLang Line Ending Policy (Determinism Guarantee)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Force LF (Line Feed) for all text files to ensure 
# identical file hashes across Windows, macOS, and Linux.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit rules for critical project files
*.py text eol=lf
*.madi text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
